OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start to the day, but
OL,6,Fdrier and brighter conditions will
OL,7,Fmove in from the south throughout the
OL,8,Fmorning. Cloud will lift, bringing
OL,9,Fsome bright spells. A few afternoon
OL,10,Fshowers possible but most will be dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly dry start to the
OL,13,Fevening with a few showers developing
OL,14,Facross Devon and Cornwall in the early
OL,15,Fhours. Staying mild for everyone.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FHeavy rain moves into the west
OL,18,Fthrough the morning with isolated
OL,19,Fshowers elsewhere. Rain spreads
OL,20,Feastwards with the risk of heavy
OL,21,Fdownpours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
